{
  "_about": "The rung-2 fable designer's own checks.json plus the reviewer's rows: feeds on the DRV8874 VM pin and declared decoupling rows for the bypass caps the datasheet names, at 2.0 mm (R2-T5). Scores: see FINDINGS R2.",
